OL,3,GNEWSAA1 carriageway closed after
OL,4,Aserious crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe northbound carriageway of the A1 in
OL,7,FNottinghamshire has been closed
OL,8,Ffollowing a serious crash.
OL,10,FNational Highways said the road had
OL,11,Fbeen closed by Nottinghamshire Police
OL,12,Fbetween the A6075 Tuxford and the A638
OL,13,FMarkham Moor for "full investigation
OL,14,Fworks".
OL,16,FA Nottinghamshire Fire and Rescue
OL,17,FService spokesperson said it was called
OL,18,Fon Sunday morning after a car collided
OL,19,Fwith a tree. Two women were taken to
OL,20,Fhospital.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
